<lang name="English" official="false">
	<string name="menu.class.hwp_firearms">Firearms Specialist</string>
	<string name="menu.class.hwp_firearms.description">A gunslinger from far-off lands. Every shot spends a round from the clip; an empty clip reloads by itself, and a dodge interrupts it. Mana powers gadgets. Specializes as a Marksman, a Demolitionist, in Assault or as an Engineer.</string>
	<string name="htitle.hwp_firearms.desc">Grants %num%% Critical Hit Chance, %num-per%% per level.</string>

	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.mastery_1.name">Marksman</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.mastery_2.name">Demolitionist</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.mastery_3.name">Assault</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.mastery_4.name">Engineer</string>

	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload.name">Reload</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload.desc">Swap in a fresh magazine without waiting for the clip to run dry: the clip refills when the reload time is up. Dodging cancels it. Cannot be used with a full clip or while shooting.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag.name">Frag Grenade</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag.desc">Lob a grenade at the target spot. It bursts for %damage% physical damage with %armor-pen% armor penetration. Orbs change the grenade's type.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger.name">Elemental Bullets</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger.desc">Every gun shot has a %chance% chance to be a fire, ice, lightning or poison round, dealing its weapon damage as that element instead of physical, without armor penetration. Skills and bonus weapons are not affected.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_fire.name">Burning Bullets</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_fire.desc">Elemental rounds are %chance% more likely to be fire.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_ice.name">Freezing Bullets</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_ice.desc">Elemental rounds are %chance% more likely to be ice.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_poison.name">Poisoning Bullets</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_poison.desc">Elemental rounds are %chance% more likely to be poison.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_lightning.name">Shocking Bullets</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_lightning.desc">Elemental rounds are %chance% more likely to be lightning.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_blind.name">Blinding Poison</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_blind.desc">Poison rounds blind for 1s. Each hit adds to the blindness.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_slow.name">Slowing Freeze</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_slow.desc">Ice rounds slow for 1s. Each hit adds to the slow.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_stun.name">Stunning Shock</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.scavenger_stun.desc">Lightning rounds stun for %duration%. Each hit adds to the stun.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.steady.name">Extended Clip Crit</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.steady.desc">Your magazines hold %clip% more rounds, and every round left in the clip gives %crit-damage% critical damage to all weapons and skills.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.steady_crit.name">Extended Crit Chance</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.steady_crit.desc">Every round left in the clip gives %crit-chance% critical hit chance.</string>

	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe.name">Sniper Shot</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe.desc">Take aim for %channel% and fire a single high-velocity round for %damage% of weapon damage with %armor-pen% armor penetration. Higher ranks aim faster. Uses mana, not rounds.</string>

	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg.name">Rocket Launcher</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg.desc">Fire a rocket that explodes for %damage% fire damage in a wide radius.</string>

	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.burst.name">Double Barrel Burst</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.burst.desc">Fire two shotgun shells in quick succession, each where you aim. A shell deals %damage% physical damage to every enemy in a wide cone, and %close-dmg% more to enemies within %close-range%. Dodging cancels the burst.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.burst_breath.name">Dragon's Breath</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.burst_breath.desc">The shells deal %damage% bonus fire damage and set the ground in their cone on fire for %duration%.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.burst_triple.name">Triple Barrel</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.burst_triple.desc">Double Barrel Burst fires three shells.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.adrenaline.name">Adrenaline</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.adrenaline.desc">Every kill gives a stack of adrenaline, up to %stacks-max%. When you take damage, all stacks are spent to heal %heal% of your maximum health each.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.adrenaline_crit.name">Critical Focus</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.adrenaline_crit.desc">%crit-chance% critical hit chance for every adrenaline stack.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.adrenaline_epipen.name">EpiPen</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.adrenaline_epipen.desc">Dodging with no adrenaline grants %stacks% stacks.</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.adrenaline.name">Adrenaline</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.adrenaline.desc">Gained from kills. Spent to heal when you take damage.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.turret.name">Deploy Turret</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.turret.desc">Place a turret at the target spot. It shoots nearby enemies for %damage% of your weapon damage, a shot every %rate%, until it is destroyed or wears down after 30 seconds. Enemies can attack it.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.turret_reinforced.name">Reinforced Turret</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.turret_reinforced.desc">Your turrets gain %health% of your maximum health.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.turret_second.name">Second Turret</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.turret_second.desc">You can have two turrets out. Placing a third destroys the oldest.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.myturret.name">My Turret!</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.myturret.desc">Standing within 10m of your turret repairs it by %repair% and makes it deal %damage% more damage. The turret glows while boosted.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.myturret_feed.name">Elemental Belt-Feed</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.myturret_feed.desc">While you stand near your turret, its rounds have a %chance% chance to be elemental, with your Elemental Bullets orbs.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.myturret_shared.name">Our Turret!</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.myturret_shared.desc">Teammates near your turrets also repair and boost them, with your bonuses. Boosts do not stack.</string>

	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_rifle.1a">Grenade Launching Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_rifle.2a">Field Grenade Launching Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_rifle.3a">Marksman's Grenade Launching Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_flamerifle.1a">Flamethrower Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_flamerifle.2a">Field Flamethrower Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_flamerifle.3a">Marksman's Flamethrower Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_autorifle.1a">Full Auto Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_autorifle.2a">Field Full Auto Rifle</string>
	<string name="equipment.twohanded.hwp_autorifle.3a">Marksman's Full Auto Rifle</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_rifle1.name">Shoot</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_rifle1.desc">Fire a three-round burst, %dmg% weapon damage a round. Uses 1 round a shot.</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_rifle1_epic.desc">Fire a three-round burst, %dmg% weapon damage a round. Uses 1 round a shot.</string>


	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.clip.name">Clip</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.clip.desc">Rounds left in your guns. Each shot uses one; when the clip runs dry you reload.</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.reloading.name">Reloading</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.reloading.desc">Reloading. The clip refills when this ends; dodging restarts it.</string>

	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_rifle_gl.name">Grenade Launcher</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_flamer.name">Flamethrower</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_flamer.desc">Hold to spray fire from the under-barrel flamethrower, %dmg% weapon damage as fire with each burst, through up to 3 enemies. Drains %mana% mana a second while held, and stops when your mana runs out. No cooldown; costs mana, not rounds.</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_autofire.name">Full Auto</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_autofire.desc">Hold to fire on full auto, %rate% rounds a second for %dmg% weapon damage each, but wildly inaccurate. Uses 1 round a shot.</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.twohanded.hwp_rifle_gl.desc">Fire an explosive shell from the under-barrel launcher for %dmg% weapon damage in an area. Point-blank it has no time to arm: it hits the first enemy as a slug for half damage and stuns it for 0.5 seconds. Costs mana, not rounds.</string>

	<string name="equipment.mainhand.hwp_glock.1a">Service Pistol</string>
	<string name="equipment.mainhand.hwp_glock.2a">Officer's Pistol</string>
	<string name="equipment.mainhand.hwp_glock.3a">Duelist's Pistol</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.mainhand.hwp_glock.name">Pistol Shots</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.mainhand.hwp_glock.desc">Fire accurate rounds for %dmg% weapon damage. With a pistol in each hand, fire from each in turn for %dual% damage, less accurately. With a Hand Cannon in the off hand, fire bursts of pistol, cannon, pistol. Uses 1 round a shot.</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.offhand.hwp_glock.name">Pistol Burst</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.offhand.hwp_glock.desc">With a pistol in each hand, fire both at once with a wide spread, %dmg% weapon damage each, using 2 rounds; with a Hand Cannon in the main hand, the same at the cannon's rate. Otherwise, fire one round.</string>
	<string name="equipment.mainhand.hwp_hcannon.1a">Hand Cannon</string>
	<string name="equipment.mainhand.hwp_hcannon.2a">Officer's Hand Cannon</string>
	<string name="equipment.mainhand.hwp_hcannon.3a">Duelist's Hand Cannon</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.mainhand.hwp_hcannon.name">Cannon Shots</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.mainhand.hwp_hcannon.desc">Fire heavy rounds for %dmg% weapon damage, half as fast as a pistol. With a pistol in the other hand, fire bursts of pistol, cannon, pistol (the pistol's rounds %pistol%). With a Hand Cannon in each hand, fire from each in turn. Uses 1 round a shot.</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.offhand.hwp_hcannon.name">Cannon Blast</string>
	<string name="skills.attacks.offhand.hwp_hcannon.desc">With a pistol or a Hand Cannon in the other hand, fire both at once with a wide spread, using 2 rounds. Otherwise, fire one heavy round for %dmg% weapon damage.</string>
	<string name="hwp.firearms.status">Firearms Specialist: class %cls%, weapon %rifle%, clip %clip%/%clipmax%, mana %mana%/%max%</string>

	<!-- Reload orbs -->
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload_dodge.name">Dodge Reload Skip</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload_dodge.desc">Dodging while reloading finishes the reload at once.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload_explosive.name">Explosive Reload</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload_explosive.desc">Reload throws the old magazine, which explodes for %damage% physical damage per round left in it. With a pistol in each hand, both magazines are thrown, one right after the other.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload_over.name">Perfect Reload</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.reload_over.desc">Every reload shows a ring with a gold mark. Hit Reload in the mark (%window%) for a perfect reload, which finishes at once: during the automatic reload, use Reload; during your own Reload, press it again. The clip then holds %rounds% more rounds, never more, until it next runs dry or a reload is not perfect.</string>

	<!-- Frag Grenade orbs: each makes the grenade a different type -->
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_stun.name">Stun Grenade</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_stun.desc">The grenade stuns and slows enemies in the blast for %duration%. Enemies that cannot be stunned are still slowed.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_fire.name">Incendiary Grenade</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_fire.desc">The grenade leaves a fire for %duration% that burns and blinds enemies standing in it.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_gas.name">Gas Grenade</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_gas.desc">The grenade leaves a poison cloud for %duration%. Fire ignites the gas.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_shrapnel.name">Shrapnel</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.frag_shrapnel.desc">Enemies damaged by your grenades lose %armor% armor for %duration%.</string>

	<!-- Marksman -->
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_headshot.name">Headshot</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_headshot.desc">The first enemy a Sniper Shot hits takes a critical hit.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_recoil.name">Recoil Roll</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_recoil.desc">The Sniper Shot's recoil throws you backwards in a dodge roll, and you evade all damage while you roll.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_recoil.buff">Recoil Roll</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_pierce.name">Piercing Bullet</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.snipe_pierce.desc">The Sniper Shot passes through %pierce% more enemies, dealing 15% less damage after each one.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.focus.name">Critical Aim</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.focus.desc">Every gun round that hits an enemy gives a Focus stack, %stacks-crit% critical hit chance and damage each, up to %stacks-max%. A round that hits nothing loses all Focus.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.focus_boom.name">BOOM Headshot!</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.focus_boom.desc">%crit-chance% critical hit chance and %crit-damage% critical damage for all weapons and skills, and double that for Sniper Shot.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.focus_exposure.name">Elemental Exposure</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.focus_exposure.desc">%crit-chance% chance to critically hit for each element (fire, ice, lightning, poison) afflicting the target.</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.focus.name">Focus</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.focus.desc">Critical hit chance and damage for every stack. Lost when a round misses.</string>

	<!-- Demolitionist -->
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_fatboy.name">Fat Boy</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_fatboy.desc">Fire a slower, heavier rocket that also deals %damage% of its damage as poison and blinds enemies for %duration%.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_magic.name">Magic Missile</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_magic.desc">The rocket explodes in ice for %damage-ice% of its damage, then bursts into flame for %damage-fire% of it.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_quad.name">Quad Missile Chambers</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_jump.name">Rocket Jump</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_jump.desc">When you are inside your own rocket's explosion, it throws you away from its center, and you evade all damage while you fly.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.rpg_quad.desc">Fire four small missiles in quick succession, each dealing %damage% of the rocket's damage in %radius% of its radius.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.hoarder.name">Ordinance Hoarder</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.hoarder.desc">The Frag Grenade, the Grenade Launcher and the Rocket Launcher recharge %cooldown% faster, and store %stacks-max% charges while ready: a stored charge is spent to use the skill again at once.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.hoarder_overpacked.name">Overpacked Explosives</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.hoarder_overpacked.desc">Explosive skills deal %damage% damage.</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.hoarder_shrapnel.name">Elemental Shrapnel</string>
	<string name="skills.hwp_firearms.hoarder_shrapnel.desc">Explosions gain %pen% fire, ice, lightning and poison penetration.</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.grenade_charges.name">Grenade Charges</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.grenade_charges.desc">Frag Grenade uses ready, counting the one off cooldown.</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.rocket_charges.name">Rocket Charges</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.rocket_charges.desc">Rocket Launcher uses ready, counting the one off cooldown.</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.gl_charges.name">Launcher Charges</string>
	<string name="stacks.hwp_firearms.gl_charges.desc">Grenade Launcher uses ready, counting the one off cooldown.</string>

